  "texts": [
    "tensquads",
    "Already have an account?",
    "Sign in",
    "Free for 14 days",
    "Run your business with a team of squads",
    "Each part of your business gets its own squad: one agent with its tools. A master squad coordinates them, and every squad works toward your mission.",
    "Orders, support, marketing, finance, stock",
    "Start with the squads you need. Add more later.",
    "You set the limits",
    "Refunds, ad spend, reorders: squads stay inside them or ask first.",
    "One chat for everything",
    "Ask the master what's going on; it routes the question to the right squad.",
    "[CUSTOMER QUOTE]",
    "[CUSTOMER NAME], [BUSINESS]",
    "Where are you starting from?",
    "This decides which squads we set up first and what we ask you to connect.",
    "A new business",
    "I have an idea or a product and nothing is set up yet. Squads help me launch: store, first products, first campaign.",
    "An existing business",
    "I already sell. Connect my store and inbox and let the squads take over the daily work.",
    "Business name",
    "Company mission",
    "(required)",
    "One or two sentences. Every squad works toward this.",
    "What will you sell, and to whom?",
    "The master uses this to brief every squad. You can change it later.",
    "Where do you plan to sell?",
    "Where do you sell today?",
    "We'll ask you to connect these on the next step. Nothing is changed in your store without your say-so.",
    "Website",
    "(optional)",
    "Roughly how many orders a month?",
    "Back",
    "Choose my squads",
    "ask-first",
    "mode; you loosen the limits once you trust it. The master will propose a mission for each squad; you approve them in your inbox.",
    "Back",
    "Create my workspace",
    "By continuing you agree to the [TERMS] and [PRIVACY POLICY]."
  ],
